0:{"buildId":"rN8qaWhn4jDk2CsuciQi1","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site py-16 md:py-24","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-16 max-w-2xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"label-mono text-accent-blue","children":"About"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl","children":"A builder, a student, and an operator."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] lg:gap-20","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["I'm ","Taiwo Adebola",", a cybersecurity student and aspiring software engineer based in ","Nigeria",". The honest summary of what I do: I build things to understand them."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["That habit started with small scripts and utilities and grew into the collection you can see in"," ",["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/projects","className":"text-accent-blue underline-offset-4 hover:underline","children":"my projects"}]," ","— a church service planner with a live document preview, a Telegram bot with memory, a fintech prototype built around a proper ledger, and a self-hosted deployment environment I operate and troubleshoot myself. None of it is decorative. Each project exists because I wanted to know how that kind of system actually works, and building it was the only honest way to find out."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The thread connecting it all is a pull toward the layer beneath the layer — what the browser actually sends, what the proxy actually does with it, what the database actually records. My study of cybersecurity sharpened that instinct into a discipline: understand the system before you trust it, and describe the system accurately before you claim anything about it."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"I distinguish carefully between what I've built and what I'm becoming. I'm not yet a professional engineer with years of production experience — I'm a serious student of the craft with a growing portfolio of real, working projects and the discipline to label them accurately. What I can offer today is genuine curiosity, honest engineering, and the habit of finishing what I start."}]]}]}],["$","$L2",null,{"delay":0.1,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","aside",null,{"aria-label":"Current focus","className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"label-mono flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-graduation-cap h-3.5 w-3.5 text-accent-blue","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","j76jl0",{"d":"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"}],["$","path","1lu8f3",{"d":"M22 10v6"}],["$","path","1r8lef",{"d":"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"}],"$undefined"]}],"Currently"]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3.5 text-sm","children":[["$","li","Studying",{"className":"grid grid-cols-[92px_1fr] gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent-blue","children":"Studying"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Cybersecurity — web security, Linux, networking"}]]}],["$","li","Building",{"className":"grid grid-cols-[92px_1fr] gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent-blue","children":"Building"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Order of Service and Verify Hub"}]]}],"$L4","$L5"]}]]}],"$L6"]}]}]]}],"$L7","$L8"]}